{"id":"546454613","kind":"article","title":"揭发内部腐败","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zqG92bvaL58AWMeL97jXaRd1Dm6hsfGvhAn"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2022-07-26","updated":"2022-07-26","votes":10,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":645,"keywords":["创造性研究","诚实沟通","反向营销","科研方法","反馈循环"],"summary":"Andy Matuschak 认为，研究者若无法预先知道解决问题的完整路线，就应留意意外数据和困难，因为突破可能藏在本想略过的异常处。他主张公开谈论工作中的真实挑战，而非把营销和探索隔离；诚实披露问题有助于形成奖励怀疑、反馈和自我修正的循环。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/546454613","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"wBU0CQLU\">如果你试图回答一个有趣的问题，你可能无法为自己写一份完整的路线图。你可以勘察情况，并尽可能地降低风险，但没有半路上遇到的机会，突发的灵光一闪，你到达不了目的地。因此，非常重要的是，你要睁大眼睛，避免自欺欺人：你的突破点，可能就藏在那个你想要一带而过的异常数据点之中。</p><p data-pid=\"1MpO2Kwl\">如果你在和自己交谈时需要非常诚实，那么你最好在和别人谈论你的工作时也要非常诚实。我认为，如果你对实际发生的事情视而不见，就不可能对你的「巨大进步」发表偏颇的营销信息。相比之下，如果你「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z21cgR9K3UcQ5a7yPsj2RUim3oM2TzdBByZu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">开门造车</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>」，开诚布公地讨论你正在努力应对的挑战（又称<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4bK6LaSBRetDzuYkeCs3A8mJ8DufTbK4o6FS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">反向营销</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>），你就会创造一个反馈循环，奖励怀疑主义和诚实的态度。你让诚信成为你身份的一部分，而不是试图将它与你的营销信息隔绝开来。</p><hr/><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h3><p data-pid=\"e_baVSSX\">与 Michael Nielsen 的对话, 2019-11-27</p><p data-pid=\"kSDHLa1W\">标题取自：</p><p data-pid=\"01PuorPe\">Tufte, E. R. (2006). <i>The cognitive style of PowerPoint: Pitching out corrupts within</i>. Cheshire, Conn.: Graphics Press.</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"S3zaUE0m\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"452746461\" href=\"#/post/452746461\">反向营销</a></li><li data-pid=\"zTUoFv3p\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"457529308\" href=\"#/post/457529308\">开门造车</a></li><li data-pid=\"w0pkuVem\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"449726755\" href=\"#/post/449726755\">Readwise</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"6TvUp4Ep\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zqG92bvaL58AWMeL97jXaRd1Dm6hsfGvhAn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pitching out corrupts within (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 开门造车 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"457529308\" href=\"#/post/457529308\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 反向营销 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"452746461\" href=\"#/post/452746461\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"545276399","title":"有效的深度工作不仅取决于时间，还取决于强度","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":23,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"546882133","title":"专注的软件开发工作是自我否定的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"449726755","title":"Readwise","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"452746461","title":"反向营销","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"457529308","title":"开门造车","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}